    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a700cd9fd4f700226786f8b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员，对面有车来了哦。\r\n……“是时候进行指令”了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49caaa6a9c194aa95d96abf0fec41bc82ed40890d3c36820ad6b9d6a527188fb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105318.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f904dd1a235a5b6fe690800",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "听到这儿，我的肩膀终于放松下来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "124be3d08338e3cd8ad2aa08d169fca9e671d125da18fad778021c1f86ec9c55",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105318.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
