    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01984bb67d8e183b018484bc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『宝冢纪念』最为合适呢。\r\n无论是“居住条件”还是“间隔”都非常理想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0307e73565420c20bbbb9ec2501e0f0680e50d40921086317b1bf9538c18d16",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105318.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ec13cb2b255f795bc3ca0c4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4d688f71d8c38a8a2d9ef98cb402b044f0892dc958bfddf71ec65b7b37fbf2f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105318.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:144d6105f12c659a59eedbc2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是，在迁移途中——",
      "source_fingerprint": "07eccee8301738806b8706a0abf0d7faf6c73d2cf25b5253c4772dafcccf3dc6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105318.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7be2467b6b30bb43815b4dd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "其他宇宙里，新宇宙在备战『宝冢纪念』时，\r\n遭遇了极其严重的伤情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ab127da4f706ca4664d1597861356ea773bf9badbece0fd7650b27f81ee7199",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105318.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c7777b4d63974e161fb825b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迄今为止，我们都算是摸着前人的轨道在前\r\n进。但接下来——\r\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4beb66dff7aeea4ad9047653d0aa395abdd312a41b71e162a386b298fab29f6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105318.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c277a67792ca79fb5d6d4695",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——我与新宇宙的旅程，算是进入了真正的\r\n“未知宙域”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d752705331b90aa04de3574adab079cfbf7831bb2f2f8615a545703e69f7f82",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105318.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3efffd6642852ef78ab62e25",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "打开那扇盛夏之门吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f87f6e7d69aa10689915a3a28625879b323f0586fa34671876f0221fda02e3ec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105318.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e89eb5cad8313275bd0e70c9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目标定为『宝冢纪念』已是定势。\r\n既然如此的话，就只剩下——",
      "source_fingerprint": "02e346c86974aac014d33be81a74245834c8743e014dd0a6aaeaa89080a95188",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105318.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3de12df7be5ba1a43184e9b8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4d688f71d8c38a8a2d9ef98cb402b044f0892dc958bfddf71ec65b7b37fbf2f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105318.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:356e09b931e716d81ae323f5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "盛夏之门——\r\n暖春就这样过去……",
      "source_fingerprint": "de1f2751939c7140388b70f0b1834f890e6a58eae9ce2abe5d6da2354a31c74c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105318.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed04c2eab95766a76624f284",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但只有今天，有些东西比结果更加重要。\r\n我带着新宇宙，去往了医院——",
      "source_fingerprint": "64c3505ac3f6aa2a78b37fc882a3be2f6feada2481c5e8da7258c869dfe2f283",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105318.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b8a6ba551777cc999479a03",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4d688f71d8c38a8a2d9ef98cb402b044f0892dc958bfddf71ec65b7b37fbf2f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105318.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bf52b09b8756b67e8f5f1c4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——盛夏之后，迈向金秋。\r\n如果要从已知的安稳宙域“脱离”的话——",
      "source_fingerprint": "65bacc34cf72abd863d065e2d61c2233f5caf4585632b0e6e126fed6f23aff9e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105318.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69d59b892f8f847f0965fe99",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那就把那场比赛当作目标吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a038c7e37d3e9716cda8604a7ba9f57f429150c6d4caeab3644914105b43124",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105318.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "choice_data_list",
