      "uid": "zhcn:807032d3cb6d52ab96f31236",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "总之，我们还是先放远目标，\r\n只求让这沉闷的氛围明朗几分。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a09730a3248422ffdf199df4a206b4fcfb543951245ed75db6c374d0a6ffffd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
