      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "若是成功抵达那里的话，\r\n便证明我们已经成功甩开了其他宇宙的悲剧宿命。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f09e978b1dec909514aaf6d7448d54b41f8f427c9848bd38246c5bf311661ab9",
